## Chart table

@sefa{emotion="shy"}: Take this. It was my grandmother's. It doesn't point north. It points up.
@ilo: Up?
@sefa: For when you're down there and you can't tell any more. Bring it back. Bring yourself back.
::use{component="keepsake" who="sefa" item="compass"}
